# Local development uses .dev.vars (not this file) -- see DEPLOY.md.
# In production these are Cloudflare Worker secrets, set with:
#   npx wrangler secret put ADMIN_PASSWORD
#
# ADMIN_PASSWORD   the admin panel password (required)
# SESSION_SECRET   signs the admin cookie (optional; falls back to ADMIN_PASSWORD)
# INGEST_TOKEN     shared with the GitHub Action that pushes scraped opportunities
#
# The weekly scraper (GitHub Actions) additionally uses:
#   SITE_URL           https://your-domain.org   (repo variable)
#   FIRECRAWL_API_KEY  optional
